OrangeIslands_Mikan_Text_Girl::
	.string "The POKeMON CENTER, the MART and\n"
	.string "four houses. That is MIKAN.\p"
	.string "Everything else is the gym, and\n"
	.string "the gym is down on the sand.$"

OrangeIslands_Mikan_Text_Man::
	.string "Trainers come off the boat, lose\n"
	.string "to CISSY, and buy a lot of\l"
	.string "POTIONs they do not need.$"

OrangeIslands_Mikan_Text_Youngster::
	.string "North of here is all water. The\n"
	.string "ORANGE ISLANDS are mostly water,\l"
	.string "when you look at a chart.$"

OrangeIslands_Mikan_Text_OldWoman::
	.string "The orchards to the south grow\n"
	.string "the fruit the island is named\l"
	.string "for. Mind the trainers in them.$"

OrangeIslands_Mikan_Text_Hiker::
	.string "Came over from SUNBURST. There is\n"
	.string "a cave on that island packed with\l"
	.string "GEODUDE and ONIX.\p"
	.string "Worth the trip before you take on\n"
	.string "CISSY. A GROUND type walks\l"
	.string "straight through an electric\l"
	.string "attack.\p"
	.string "Thought you might want that in\n"
	.string "your pocket.$"

OrangeIslands_Mikan_Text_Boy::
	.string "I am going to be in the ORANGE\n"
	.string "CREW. You have to beat all four\l"
	.string "gyms first. I have beaten none.$"
